  "body": "## Release v2.0.6 - Full Code Restructuring\n\n### Phase 1: Code Quality\n- Standardized logging: replaced Debug.WriteLine with SilksongCoopPlugin.LogWarn\n- Added XML documentation to ~285+ public APIs\n- Fixed 4 inappropriate null-forgiving operators\n\n### Phase 2: Code Navigation\n- Added #region blocks to all 26 files >200 lines\n- Organized code into logical sections: Fields, Properties, Constructors, Unity Lifecycle, Public Methods, Private Methods, etc.\n- Improved code readability and maintainability\n\n**Download:** SilksongCoop_v2.0.6.zip — extract to game folder, overwrite existing files.\n\n**Note:** This is a maintenance release with no gameplay changes. All 614 tests passing."
